{"overview":"پس از شکست ماجین بُو، خدای نابودگر قدرتمندی به نام بیرس به دنبال ساییان جنگجویی می‌گردد که فریزا را شکست داده است. با درک تهدیدی که بیرس برای زمین دارد، مبارزان Z باید او را متوقف کنند. تنها گوکو، آخرین امید بشریت، می‌تواند به سطح افسانه‌ای سوپر ساییان گاد برسد و سیاره را نجات دهد و شاید کل جهان!","tagline":"","overview_en":"After the defeat of Majin Buu, a powerful God of Destruction known as Beerus searches for the Saiyan warrior who defeated Frieza. Realizing the threat Beerus poses to Earth, the Z-fighters must stop him. Only Goku, humanity’s last hope, can ascend to the level of a legendary Super Saiyan God and save the planet, and possibly the entire universe!","tagline_en":"Be there when a hero becomes a god.","runtime":85,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["細田雅弘"],"crew_en":["Masahiro Hosoda"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"野沢雅子","role":"Son Goku / Son Gohan / Son Goten (voice)","photo":"/jxbXdejmPoiKnNoQz7Dkb80qC26.jpg","en":"Masako Nozawa"},{"name":"کو ایچی یامادرا","role":"Beerus (voice)","photo":"/biov5jENp2XYfehkcdnRvi796Wi.jpg","en":"Koichi Yamadera"},{"name":"森田成一","role":"Whis (voice)","photo":"/2INsHYbx9gEhhzXPHdqBDdvHjFt.jpg","en":"Masakazu Morita"},{"name":"堀川りょう","role":"Vegeta (voice)","photo":"/vZ69WQJfR5D2xow5FkddduRjq6c.jpg","en":"Ryo Horikawa"},{"name":"鶴ひろみ","role":"Bulma Briefs (voice)","photo":"/oFU9CCNLUhklLhEuLutM0FyTUbt.jpg","en":"Hiromi Tsuru"},{"name":"八奈見乗児","role":"Kaio / Dr. Briefs / Narrator (voice)","photo":"/khkGvegnYvx50pAEF1lms7ZKBqy.jpg","en":"Joji Yanami"},{"name":"古川登志夫","role":"Piccolo (voice)","photo":"/zZjO0NxIbEhYW3507gXVnvWeRkG.jpg","en":"Toshio Furukawa"},{"name":"中川翔子","role":"Oracle Fish (voice)","photo":"/4ZBdHVfs9sezLiz1ixusv1wgT1Y.jpg","en":"Shoko Nakagawa"},{"name":"内海賢二","role":"Shenlong (voice)","photo":"/8rNvgs40LJbCbjf7qFCfDeKBnIk.jpg","en":"Kenji Utsumi"},{"name":"田中真弓","role":"Kuririn (voice)","photo":"/by4t1tYtEXsfbFj9TvOjozBmQla.jpg","en":"Mayumi Tanaka"},{"name":